[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]date suggestion whenever the current task already has a priority.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]priority_property.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/priority_property.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-e[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-e/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config schema for `values: priority`[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: teach the bullet-property config loader a `values: priority` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kind with a validated `levels` list (label, value, day range) and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`schedules` target, and add the `priority` entry to the chezmoi-managed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob/config.yml.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Priority value stage and single-task write[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker: render the P2/P3/P4 value stage, roll a random date from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chosen level's day range, and write the priority field plus the derived [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scheduled value in one guarded edit that reuses the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Blocked/recovery and project-frontmatter behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Counted-session priority writes[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]counted[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]counted: extend the counted batch planner so N<Ctrl+Shift+P> applies one[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]priority to every counted task while rolling an independent scheduled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]date per task.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Priority-derived suggestion in the date picker[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]suggest[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]suggest: pin a visually distinct, re-rollable suggested date at the top [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the `scheduled` value stage whenever the current task (or every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counted task) already has a priority.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, version bump, and vault deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]release[dim] · [dim][/dim]after counted, suggest[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]release: document the new property kind, bump the plugin manifest and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, and deploy the plugin to the vault.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-e","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-e.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-33e1ecb950e024130abe0902de064e44","started_at":"2026-08-03T08:08:56.013963+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"32d960f3bb38fa4d511aba2ddb6d78bba675db7fe47ed649e6bb36f53d83961a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-e.4/chat.md","size_bytes":5190},"commits":{"digest":"5c0cd25568c12915394fea2a1c0489b826c411bc1b331be712806a29d4221b82","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-e.4/commits.json